Travel with Google Earth", "keywords": ["GoogleEarth", "travel", "timetravel", "magic", "history"], "long_description": "**Miss New York\u2019s classic yellow cabs in Times Square?**  \n\n**Curious how the Eiffel Tower or Notre-Dame evolved through the decades?**\n\n**Revisit** lets you explore the past and present of **any real place**\u2014powered by Google Street View.  {4125580237715811}\nFrom famous landmarks to your old neighborhood, watch how places change over time in immersive 360\u00b0.\n\n\ud83c\udf00 **Drag the Time Rift** \u2014 a split between two timelines \u2014 to compare \u201cThen\u201d and \u201cNow.\u201d  \n\n\u2728 **Customize the Time Rift\u2019s visual style**: glow lines, glitch edges, vintage fades, and more.\n{1364211852074382}\n\n\ud83e\udded **Curated Scenes**  \nHand picked locations that highlight the most dramatic **before and after** transformations.  \n\n\ud83c\udf0d **Featured Destinations**\n- \ud83d\ude95 **Times Square** \u2013 From grit to glitz  \n- \ud83d\udfe3 **Las Vegas Sphere** \u2013 What came before  \n- \ud83d\udd32 **Shibuya Crossing** \u2013 Before the digital flood  \n- \ud83d\uddfc **Eiffel Tower** \u2013 Decades of change  \n- \u26ea **Notre-Dame** \u2013 From tragedy to rebirth\n{1496770768298592}\n\nYou're not limited to presets \u2014 **time travel anywhere** Street View goes.  \nYour own street. A dream trip. A place that no longer exists.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d **Open Exploration**  \nJump to **any real place** Street View covers and **walk through it step by step** using immersive **node to node movement**,  now with an optional **HD 8K** mode and **satellite map** views.\n{1499057167861481}\n\n\ud83d\udca1 **What Makes It Unique**\n- \ud83c\udf00 **Time Rift**: Swipe to reveal the past \u2014 and style it your way  \n- \ud83c\udf10 **Real-world locations**, not fiction or CGI  \n- \ud83e\udded **Curated scenes + open exploration**\n{1360640898988536}\n\n**Try Revisit VR \u2014 and tell us where you want to go next.**\n\n**Discord**: https://discord.gg/X5pZxBdcgn  \n\n**Email**: support@revisitvr.com\n", "short_description": "Go anywhere, anywhen. Explore the past and present of any real place with Google Street View.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Revisit", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://revisitvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Revisit", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://revisitvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26495570346711592"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_905874858787809_7316013011302063010_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LxZvMOZbXpgQ7kNvwFEgrtO&_nc_oc=AdkaHqHgGkKI-_ZwPVsRRlLihY3MnwdBHXoHsVAKzD_kqFWpH3mzA3smk8rEeKfHBSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvH1xFT_Rmgr2NqPRV3EWtXSZmoPmEXw0tFrEginbK9Kg&oe=69A6BC63"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Revisit: Time Travel with Google Earth", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}, {"topic_name": "Creativity", "id": "1819021644882647"}], "release_date": 1760